<title>GERMANY: Caradon raises stake in Weru.</title>
<headline>Caradon raises stake in Weru.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>U.K. firm Caradon Plc on Monday said it increased its stake in German window and door manufacturer Weru AG to 64.8 percent.</p>
<p>Caradon previously held 50.1 percent in the German group. During the course of the day the U.K. firm had purchased 84,244 Weru shares for a total of 56.4 million marks, Caradon said in a statement.</p>
<p>The increased stake in the German firm is designed to strengthen ties between the two groups, Caradon added.</p>
<p>--Frankfurt Newsroom, +49 69 756525</p>
</text>
